  <item>
    <title>Vol.3｜被「低价平替」背刺的年轻人</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/678a2df7acc25c38ad5b70dc</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">678a2df7acc25c38ad5b70dc</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 17 Jan 2025 12:29:39 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>曾经很追捧大牌「平替」的沛沛，为何会彻底改变这一购物心态？本期节目，聪奇和沛沛从各自的角度分享对于平替商品流行背后的思考。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【加入听友群】</span></p><span></span><p><span>添加节目小助手微信：ChicNomad001</span></p><span></span><p><span>与主播和全国听友一起，畅所欲言</span></p><span></span><p><span>【节目时点】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="128">02:08</a> 作为消费者，沛沛曾经对「平替」深信不疑</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="203">03:23</a> 「平替」与「原版」护肤商品的核心技术差异点</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="240">04:00</a> 「平替」最流行的三个类目及其原因</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="553">09:13</a> 「平替」流行背后，有哪些与消费决策有关的心理学分析</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="677">11:17</a> 「不配得感」或许也在长期影响我们的购买决策</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="950">15:50</a> 从卖方视角，聪奇分享从事定价工作的观察</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1180">19:40</a> 通过坐标系形成的四象限，理性评估购物决策</span></p><span></span><p><span>【补充阅读】</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/93tzbJbzHu5iYN_-tDauUQ" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/93tzbJbzHu5iYN_-tDauUQ"><span>《被低价伤害的年轻人》</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>购物决策四象限</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnMdL08_bR1G4hv8PnJjNwqcUN11.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>【关于节目】</span></p><span></span><p><span>《中场褪黑素》是一档伴侣谈话节目，分享和探讨30岁这个特殊时期的我们，如何在职场、心理、亲密关系和个人成长等多个维度看待生命中的转折点。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【关于主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>沛沛：成长中的心理咨询师，30岁二硕华中师范大学MAP在读（小红书：</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5f20fa670000000001004a02?xsec_token=YBzsgABs-vxDDbcralFyJu6fHW_E6eA2hosXWF_nAsPt0%3D&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=63eb8ffb000000002600432f&amp;apptime=1740705494&amp;share_id=ef34984b3ebc45d1b5225a5c951948d7&amp;share_channel=copy_link" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5f20fa670000000001004a02?xsec_token=YBzsgABs-vxDDbcralFyJu6fHW_E6eA2hosXWF_nAsPt0%3D&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=63eb8ffb000000002600432f&amp;apptime=1740705494&amp;share_id=ef34984b3ebc45d1b5225a5c951948d7&amp;share_channel=copy_link"><span>阿删的治愈花园</span></a><span>）</span></p><span></span><p><span>聪奇：科技创业公司商业化负责人</span></p><span></span><p><span>【音乐】</span></p><span></span><p><span>水泡</span></p>]]></description>
